<Base title="About Rythero — Music creation tools for creators" description="Rythero is an independent web platform for AI-assisted music creation, with practical tools for song planning, prompts, audio analysis and learning." canonical="/about">
<section class="shell about"><div class="eyebrow">About Rythero</div><h1>Music creation tools built for clarity.</h1><p>Rythero is an independent web platform for modern music creators. It combines practical song-planning tools, prompt building, audio analysis and concise learning resources in one place.</p><p>The goal is simple: help creators turn an idea into a clearer musical direction while keeping creative decisions in their hands. Rythero focuses on useful workflows, transparent uncertainty and building an original sound rather than copying an artist.</p><div class="actions"><a class="pill primary" href="/tools/song-studio">Open Rythero Studio</a><a class="pill" href="/learn">Explore the School</a></div></section>
<style>.about{max-width:820px;padding:90px 0 120px}.about h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,7vw,5.5rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:14px 0 28px}.about p{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:760px}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px}</style>
</Base>